## Cross-domain interfaces

- \`e-export\`: Full stack \`db\` → AI \`history\` over SQL
- \`e-publish\`: Hardware \`esp32\` → Full stack \`mqtt\` over MQTT (Telemetry)
- \`e-score\`: Full stack \`api\` → AI \`anomaly\` over HTTP (Features)
- \`e-summary\`: Full stack \`api\` → AI \`llm\` over HTTP

